OL,3,GNEWSALike father, daughter, brother and
OL,4,Anephew: Meet the firefighting family
OL,5,
OL,6,FFew things make a parent prouder than
OL,7,Fseeing their children follow in their
OL,8,Ffootsteps. For Philip Gould, that pride
OL,9,Fis felt every day.
OL,11,FThe Peterborough firefighter has
OL,12,Fwatched not only his two daughters, but
OL,13,Falso his brother and nephew join the
OL,14,Ffire service in Cambridgeshire, turning
OL,15,Fa profession into a family tradition.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
