OL,3,GNEWSALike father, daughter, brother and
OL,4,Anephew: Meet the firefighting family
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I am immensely proud... to know that
OL,7,Fthe whole of your family and especially
OL,8,Fyour children are following in a career
OL,9,Fwhich you've had for most of your work
OL,10,Flife," says 59-year-old Philip, who
OL,11,Fjoined the service in 1995 and
OL,12,Fcontinues to work on-call.
OL,14,F"It's a wonderful, rewarding career,
OL,15,Fand both of my children and my nephew
OL,16,Fare going to love it."
